    groupTitles:
    - Emu in the Sky
    - Untitled
    - Gunyalungalung
    groupInfo:
    - "Group: Aboriginals  \r\n\nContinent: Australia \r\n\nArtist: Barnaby and Ray\n   
      Norris\r\nYear: Approx. 2007\r\n\nMedium: Photograph \r\n\nLocation: N/A\r"
    - "Group: Aboriginals \r\n\nContinent: Australia\r\n\nArtist: Belanjee\r\n\nYear:
      Unknown\r\n\nMedium: Acrylic on canvas\r\n\nLocation: N/A\r"
    - "Group: Aboriginal\r\n\nContinent: Australia\r\n\nArtist: Belanjee\r\n\nYear:
      Unknown \r\n\nMedium: Ochre on paper\r\n\nLocation: Unknown"
    groupShortInfo:
    - "\rAustralia, a continent and country, boasts a unique blend of Indigenous
      and immigrant cultures. Its multicultural society values outdoor living, sports,
      arts, and a laid-back lifestyle. The land Down Under offers diverse landscapes,
      from arid deserts to lush coastlines."
    - "\rAustralia, a continent and country, boasts a unique blend of Indigenous
      and immigrant cultures. Its multicultural society values outdoor living, sports,
      arts, and a laid-back lifestyle. The land Down Under offers diverse landscapes,
      from arid deserts to lush coastlines."
