      and immigrant cultures. Its multicultural society values outdoor living, sports,
      arts, and a laid-back lifestyle. The land Down Under offers diverse landscapes,
      from arid deserts to lush coastlines."
  religionGroup:
    groupSprites:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: e64dfe12b66d4324bb1539be531f0e08, type: 3}
